{"texte":"A supervolcano sleeps under Yellowstone. If it woke up, here's what would happen, minute by minute. In the first minutes, clouds of burning ash race out faster than a car. Anyone within dozens of kilometers would have no chance. Within an hour, a column of ash shoots more than 30 kilometers into the sky. In the next days, ash falls over much of North America. Enough to crush roofs near the volcano, and to ground planes far away. Within weeks, sulfur gas veils the Sun across the whole planet. For years, the world gets a few degrees colder. A volcanic winter. Harvests fail, and the whole world could go hungry. Sounds crazy? In 1816, the far smaller Tambora eruption already caused a year without a summer. The good news? Yellowstone's last super eruption was 640,000 years ago, and scientists see no sign of the next one.","caracteres":["A"," ","s","u","p","e","r","v","o","l","c","a","n","o"," ","s","l","e","e","p","s"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","Y","e","l","l","o","w","s","t","o","n","e","."," ","I","f"," ","i","t"," ","w","o","k","e"," ","u","p",","," ","h","e","r","e","'","s"," ","w","h","a","t"," ","w","o","u","l","d"," ","h","a","p","p","e","n",","," ","m","i","n","u","t","e"," ","b","y"," ","m","i","n","u","t","e","."," ","I","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","m","i","n","u","t","e","s",","," ","c","l","o","u","d","s"," ","o","f"," ","b","u","r","n","i","n","g"," ","a","s","h"," ","r","a","c","e"," ","o","u","t"," ","f","a","s","t","e","r"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","a"," ","c","a","r","."," ","A","n","y","o","n","e"," ","w","i","t","h","i","n"," ","d","o","z","e","n","s"," ","o","f"," ","k","i","l","o","m","e","t","e","r","s"," ","w","o","u","l","d"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","n","o"," ","c","h","a","n","c","e","."," ","W","i","t","h","i","n"," ","a","n"," ","h","o","u","r",","," ","a"," ","c","o","l","u","m","n"," ","o","f"," ","a","s","h"," ","s","h","o","o","t","s"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","3","0"," ","k","i","l","o","m","e"